\section{Multi-Node Spatial Expansion}

Graph topology:
\begin{equation}
\mathcal{G} = (\mathcal{V}, \mathcal{E}).
\end{equation}

Consensus update:
\begin{equation}
\hat{x}_i^{(k+1)} =
\hat{x}_i^{(k)}
+ \sum_{j \in \mathcal{N}_i}
W_{ij} (\hat{x}_j^{(k)} - \hat{x}_i^{(k)}).
